OL,3,GNEWSANew Dorking Wanderers owners set
OL,4,Asights on league
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's more of an adventure, you just
OL,7,Fhope you don't lose all your money."
OL,9,FThat's the moto of Dorking Wanderers
OL,10,Fnew American co-owners Frank Villares
OL,11,Fand Debra Tucker who have acquired a
OL,12,Fstake in the club.
OL,14,FFounded by manager and majority owner
OL,15,FMarc White, the club has risen from
OL,16,Fbeing a Sunday league team in the late
OL,17,F90's to now sitting in the National
OL,18,FLeague South, the sixth tier of English
OL,19,Ffootball.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
